sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Grid cell
    participant Coil as Coil (Ch 56)
    participant CDN as CDN (Ch 56)
    participant Gen as ThumbnailGenerator
    participant Cache as Thumbnail cache (Ch 12/25)

    alt remote asset
        UI->>Coil: load url?w=cellWidth (Ch 56)
        Coil->>CDN: fetch right-sized thumbnail (edge-cached)
        CDN-->>UI: thumbnail (cheap)
    else local asset (video poster)
        UI->>Cache: get(sourceId+size)
        alt hit
            Cache-->>UI: cached thumbnail file
        else miss
            UI->>Gen: generate off-main (MediaMetadataRetriever frame)
            Gen->>Cache: put(key, file) [app-internal]
            Cache-->>UI: thumbnail file (Coil loads it)
        end
    end
